      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET AGRIPPINA (1) is worth forgiving for her last effort when fifth (23.04) at this track over 400m. Hard to knock her form from this box, unbeaten in two starts. Has ability and is a key runner. SHEERAN MELODY (3) turned heads when posting a convincing 22.35 over 400m at this track three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Must include on winning run three back. WAVE OF FUN (4) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 2.75 lengths into third (22.92) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 400m. The form out of last run is most impressive. Bold showing expected. CANYA CELESTE (7) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to turn the form around.",
